ory":"battle","text":"好疼…","text_original":"いた…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯~呗~！","text_original":"んべぇ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"让你们见识一下……我的炼金术。","text_original":"私の錬金術……見せてあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"命运……指引着我们……。","text_original":"運命が……私たちを導くの……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"那边……有种命运的感觉。","text_original":"あっちに……運命を感じる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_move_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"要像幽灵一样……安静地……。","text_original":"幽霊みたいに……静かに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_move_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"身体……变暖和了呢。","text_original":"体が……あったまるねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"是不是，有点太依赖命运了…？","text_original":"運命に、甘えすぎちゃったかな…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"来咯唷~","text_original":"行くよ〜","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"这下就~","text_original":"これで〜","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"咿唏~","text_original":"イヒッ〜","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"通过~","text_original":"つうか～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"咿唏，这也是命运。","text_original":"イヒッ、これも運命。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"相信神秘者，得胜。","text_original":"オカルトを信じる者が、勝つんだよぉ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"前世……没有来过这里……。","text_original":"前世で……こんなとこには来てない……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"神秘学的物品……也得放一点才行。","text_original":"オカルトグッズも……置いとかなきゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"那边……好像有着“某种”存在。","text_original":"あそこ……”何か”いるねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"有没有……什么狭窄阴暗的地方……。","text_original":"狭くて暗い場所……ないかな……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"召唤仪式……在这里施展也没关系吗？","text_original":"召喚の儀……ここでやってもいいかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"𠳐~。","text_original":"バァ～ン。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"老师的手……好暖和。","text_original":"先生の手……あったかい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"那只乌鸦……是不认识的孩子呢。","text_original":"そのカラス……知らない子だねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"喜欢我吗？要好好……说出来哦？咿唏……。","text_original":"私のこと、好きぃ？ちゃんと……言葉にして？イヒッ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"请随意抚摸……就像前世那样。","text_original":"好きなだけ撫でなよ……前世みたいにさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"欢迎来到神秘研……老师。","text_original":"オカ研にようこそぉ……先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"……学院的秘密，在等着我们。","text_original":"……学院の秘密が、待ってるよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"沉睡的秘密……还有很多唷？","text_original":"眠っている秘密が……たくさんあるんだよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_season_2_1","category":"event","text":"警告，警告，活动即将结束！","text_original":"ケイコク、ケイコク！マモナクイベントガ終了シマス！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_season_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_season_2_2","category":"event","text":"……所以说啊。","text_original":"……だってさぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_season_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"辛苦了，老师。这份回忆……会一直保存到来世。咿唏。","text_original":"お疲れ様、先生。この思い出は……来世まで持ってくよぉ。イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"狂猎学院……还有很多不为人知的秘密哦。","text_original":"ワイルドハントには……まだ知られざる秘密がいっぱいあるよぉ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"原来，是喜欢我吗……？好开心……咿唏！","text_original":"私のこと、好きなんだ……？嬉しい……イヒヒッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"今天，就到这吧，辛苦了。","text_original":"今日は、この辺で、お疲れ様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"居然能解开这个秘密……老师真厉害呢。","text_original":"この秘密を解けるなんて……先生はすごいねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"辛苦了……大家都很高兴哦。咿唏。","text_original":"お疲れ様ぁ……みんなも喜ぶよぉ。イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"为了老师……整理了学院的秘密哦。","text_original":"先生のために……学院の秘密をまとめたよぉ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"现在……一起解明秘密吧。","text_original":"さ……一緒に解き明かそうかぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_eventmission_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"来一杯……怎么样？","text_original":"一杯……どう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"我推荐……这个。","text_original":"これ……おすすめ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"我能保证这对身体有益……。","text_original":"体にいいのは保証するよ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"咿唏，这样啊……。","text_original":"イヒッ、そっかぁ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"明明很美味的……","text_original":"美味しいのに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"那就由我来喝掉……。","text_original":"じゃあ私が飲もうかな……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"不愧是老师……我就知道，对吧。咿唏唏。","text_original":"さすが先生……わかってる、ねぇ。イヒヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"我知道的……我是必不可少的，对吧？","text_original":"わかってたよ……私が必要だって、ね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"前世……也是您选择了我呢。","text_original":"前世でも……私を選んでくれたもんねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"咿唏唏……","text_original":"イヒヒッ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"狂烈艺术学院的板垣庚……。我已知晓，我们于今日的相会。我们，是由命运的红线连接在一起的呢……咿唏。","text_original":"ワイルドハント芸術学院の板垣カノエ……。今日、会えることも……知ってたよ。私たち、赤い糸で結ばれてるからね……イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"身高……已经不会再长了吗。","text_original":"背も……伸びないかなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"灵魂在舞动……咿唏。","text_original":"魂が躍ってるよぉ……イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"炼金术的可能性……又拓宽了呢。","text_original":"錬金術の可能性が……広がるねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"新的实验……要来试试吗。","text_original":"新しい実験……してみようかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"我……体温比较低。","text_original":"私……体温が低いんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以，没认在身边为我提供温暖……可不行呢……咿唏。","text_original":"だから、そばであっためてもらわないと……ダメなの……イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"多亏了这个发圈……我，已经变得能“看见”了。","text_original":"このヘアゴムのお陰で……私、\"見える”んだよねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"咿唏……开玩笑的……。","text_original":"イヒッ……冗談だよぉ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"我的特制药水……要来点吗？","text_original":"私の特製ポーション……いるぅ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"为了老师……“各种各样”的东西都加进去了唷。","text_original":"先生のために……「いろいろ」入れたんだぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"命运……是“存在”的唷……。","text_original":"運命は……”在る”んだよ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"我们能够相会……就是证明。","text_original":"私たちの出会いが……それを証明してる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"无论什么声音我都能发出来唷……。","text_original":"私はどんな声でも出せるよぉ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"有想听的声线的话，无论哪种都可以说唷……。","text_original":"聞いてみたい声質があったら、なんでも言ってねぇ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，我在等你唷。从前世开始，一直。","text_original":"先生、待ってたよ。前世から、ずっと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师……。","text_original":"おかえり、先生……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师……那个，收录之前……有件事想请您听一下。","text_original":"せ、先生……その、収録の前に……聞いてほしいことがあるの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"其，其实……我，一直都有所隐瞒……。","text_original":"じ、実は……私、ずっと隠してたことがあって……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"我，我……其实非常害羞，没法好好说话。","text_original":"わ、私……恥ずかしがり屋で、うまく話せなくて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"为了掩饰，才扮演了这种阴暗系角色……。","text_original":"それを隠すために、陰気なキャラを演じてた……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"接触神秘学，也是想要改变自己。","text_original":"オカルトに手を出したのも、自分を変えたかったから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"知道这件事的……只有老师。","text_original":"これを知っているのは……先生だけ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以……请帮我保密唷？","text_original":"だから……内緒にしてね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我，相信老师……。","text_original":"せ、先生のこと、信じてる、よ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"……咿唏，咿唏唏。呐，您信了？","text_original":"……イヒッ、イヒヒ。ねえ、信じたぁ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您喜欢可爱的东西对吧？","text_original":"先生は、可愛いものが好きなんでしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_6_1","category":"lobby","text":"那么，也应该会……喜欢我吧？","text_original":"じゃあ、私のことも……好き、だよねぇ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_6_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_memoriallobby_6_2","category":"lobby","text":"咿唏……！","text_original":"イヒッ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_memoriallobby_6_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老——师♪庚，好开心啊♡……是不是很厉害？咿唏。","text_original":"せーんせ♪カノエ、うれしいなっ♡……上手だった？イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"咿唏……老师……和“那个时候”一样呢","text_original":"イヒッ……先生……『あのとき』と同じだねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"我，我只剩下老师了……这不是演技唷。这就是，真实的现实。谢，谢谢。","text_original":"わ、私には先生しかいないの……お芝居じゃないよ。これは、真実。あ、ありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"咿唏……咿唏咿唏唏……！","text_original":"イヒッ……イヒイヒヒッ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天是亡灵节……也是我的生日。","text_original":"今日は死者の日で……私の誕生日。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"思念着沉睡的灵魂们……一起祈祷吧。","text_original":"眠れる魂たちを想って……一緒に祈ろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐……老师。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとう……先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"前世也……像这样为您祝福了呢。咿唏……。","text_original":"前世でも……お祝いしたねぇ。イヒヒッ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节……神秘研漫长阴暗之中的光明之日。","text_original":"ハロウィン……オカ研が暗闇の中で輝く日。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"来吧，一起来做南瓜灯吧……咿唏。","text_original":"さぁ、かぼちゃのランタンを作ろうかぁ……イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师。今年也请多多关照。","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。本年もどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"刚刚的语气……是不是很有大人范？咿唏……。","text_original":"いまの、大人っぽかった？イヒッ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节能和老师一起度过什么的，庚，好开心♡","text_original":"クリスマスを先生と過ごせるなんて、カノエ、うれしいっ♡","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天，可不会让您离开的哦♡。","text_original":"今日はもう、離さないんだからっ♡","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"我会努力的，老师。我会，更努力的。","text_original":"頑張ろね、先生。私も、もっと努力するから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"下次，会更努力的。","text_original":"次はもっと、頑張る。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"我会保护你的。和前世一样……好吗？","text_original":"護ってあげる。前世と同じように……ね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"我的手很冰冷……但心却热忱。","text_original":"私の手は冷たいけど……心は熱いんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"和“那个时候”一样的结果呢……咿唏。","text_original":"『あのとき』と同じ結果だねぇ……。イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"咿唏……这次胜利也是……命中注定的呢。","text_original":"イヒッ……この勝利も……運命で定まってるの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/ch0306_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0306_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝……档案……咿唏。","text_original":"ブルー……アーカイブ……イヒッ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/jp/CH0306_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0306_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9D%BF%E5%9E%A3%20%E5%BA%9A/original/kr/ch0306_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0306_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%9